GolangTAKServer is the experimental native TAK service for the Pi 5 image.

It runs without Docker under OpenWrt procd and stores its configuration,
certificates, users, logs, and data under /opt/golangtakserver. On first boot,
read the generated administrator password from:

    /opt/golangtakserver/admin-password.txt

The normal TAK listeners are TCP 8087 and TLS 8089. The dashboard uses HTTP
8090, HTTPS 8443, and enrollment 8446. Port 8080 is intentionally unused by
this service. Create client connection packages or QR codes from the dashboard.

The packaged binary is GolangTAKServer 1.6.3 for Linux ARM64. Its upstream
license is installed at /opt/golangtakserver/LICENSE.
